== r3.82 (CANON-5, CANON-8): a field of a type parameter has no implicit
== value, whatever the instance: TBox<Integer> needs a construction.
Type
    TBox<T> Struct
        FValue T
    ;

Main :
    D TBox<Integer>
    PutLn(D.FValue)
;
